* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Design references under .ai/board/**/design/ and .ai/board/ideas/ — added 2026-09-04 with
# ui-design-system.md § Visual specification, the first thing in this repository that is not text.
# `text=auto` above already auto-detects binary, so these lines are belt and braces: they make the
# intent explicit and they stop a future `* text` from mangling an image on checkout.
*.png  -text
*.jpg  -text
*.jpeg -text
*.gif  -text
*.webp -text
*.pdf  -text
